      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{依题意有}\\qquad\\qquad\\overline{X}\\sim N(\\mu,\\frac{100}{n}),\\\\&amp;\\text{即}\\qquad\\qquad\\frac{\\overline{X}-\\mu}{10\\sqrt{n}}\\sim N(0,1),\\\\&amp;\\text{于是由}P\\{\\mu-5&lt;\\overline{X}&lt;\\mu+5\\}=0.954\\text{有}\\\\&amp;\\qquad P\\{\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}&lt;\\frac{\\overline{X}-\\mu}{10\\sqrt{n}}&lt;\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\}=0.954\\\\&amp;\\Rightarrow 2\\Phi(\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2})-1=0.954\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\Phi(\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2})=0.977\\,,\\\\&amp;\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}=2\\ \\Rightarrow\\ n=16\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{依题意有}\\qquad\\qquad\\overline{X}\\sim N(\\mu,\\frac{100}{n}),\\\\&amp;\\text{即}\\qquad\\qquad\\frac{\\overline{X}-\\mu}{10\\sqrt{n}}\\sim N(0,1),\\\\&amp;\\text{于是由}P\\{\\mu-5&lt;\\overline{X}&lt;\\mu+5\\}=0.954\\text{有}\\\\&amp;\\qquad P\\{\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}&lt;\\frac{\\overline{X}-\\mu}{10\\sqrt{n}}&lt;\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\}=0.954\\\\&amp;\\Rightarrow 2\\Phi(\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2})-1=0.954\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\Phi(\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2})=0.977\\,,\\\\&amp;\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}=2\\ \\Rightarrow\\ n=16\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
